    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `extract_receipt_fields.py` that extracts merchant, tax, total, and items from a receipt, I need to choose a concrete external provider for document extraction. I will use Amazon Textract, which is a powerful service for extracting text and data from documents. I will include the necessary imports and use the service-specific client class to make it identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866548611,
          "start": 1789866544243
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc5c0c73001JkUcw0yubX3eWg",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc5c07b60013eCd8q0yNfMPj1",
